OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FOvernight mist and fog slowly
OL,6,Flingers through the morning and clears
OL,7,Fto a fine afternoon with variable
OL,8,Fcloud and the odd sunny spell for many
OL,9,Fareas, Light winds. Feeling mild.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FPartly cloudy with clear
OL,12,Fspells leading to widespread mist and
OL,13,Ffog developing overnight, particularly
OL,14,Fthrough Cambridgeshire. Light winds.
OL,15,FTemperatures mostly around average,
OL,16,Fbut turning chilly in clearer rural
OL,17,Fareas.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
