OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FOvernight mist and fog clears
OL,6,Fslowly through the morning to give a
OL,7,Freasonable afternoon with sunny
OL,8,Fspells. Widespread fog likely to
OL,9,Fredevelop overnight. Light winds. Mild
OL,10,Fby day, chilly overnight.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FA
OL,13,Freasonable afternoon on Saturday once
OL,14,Fovernight fog clears. Cloudy with some
OL,15,Flight rain on Sunday. Becoming dry and
OL,16,Fpartly cloudy into Monday. Light
OL,17,Fwinds. Temperatures near normal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
